  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>With the&nbsp;new Container Storage Interface (CSI) extensible API, you&nbsp;can now disable and enable any of the AKS supported CSI drivers (disk, files).&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/csi-storage-drivers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "With the new Container Storage Interface (CSI) extensible API, you can now disable and enable any of the AKS supported CSI drivers (disk, files).\n\nLearn more ."
  },
